<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15901" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχῆθεν</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχηγ-ᾶθεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from the beginning, from of
				old,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.131
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.7.5
			</span></i>; rare in Trag., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				416
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				126
			</span></i>; condemned by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				75
			</span></i>; freq. in later Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.50.5
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.238e
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>immediately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> with neg.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέσσον . . ἀρχῆθεν μὴ
			ἐλθεῖν</span> not <i>at all,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.18
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			 c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
